      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "To which of the following sets do all the natural numbers belong?\n\nI. $\\mathbb{Z}^{+}$\n\nII. $\\mathbb{Z}^{-}$\n\nIII. $\\mathbb{Q}^{+}$\n\nIV. $\\mathbb{Q}^{-}$",
